    "updated_at": "2020-03-10T20:48:41Z",
    "body": "I _think_ just adding `object` to `AttributeNameKeyword` is workable.  At least it does not seem to lead to any parsing ambiguities that I can find.\r\n\r\nDoing something more generic, I'm not sure, not least in terms of how to express it to parsers.",
